<item><title>Bangui court issues questionable arrest warrant for MP</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cf/bangui-court-issues-questionable-arrest-warrant-for-mp-aa02a8/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cf/bangui-court-issues-questionable-arrest-warrant-for-mp-aa02a8/</guid><category>Central African Republic</category><description>A document dated November 2, 2026, purportedly from a Bangui judge, orders the arrest of MP Élie-Allard Namtoli without specifying charges or citing immunity.</description><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cf.jpg" length="41097" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cf.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
